  "Onboarding Phases": 'content.onboardingPhases',
  "Mrs. Wanpen Yamploy (Head of Accounting) and Mrs. Jirapon (Accounting Assistant) will guide new employees through onboarding.": 'content.mrsWanpenYamployHeadOfAccountingAnd',
  "Objective: maintaining complete, transparent, and verifiable financial records that accurately reflect the company’s operations.": 'content.objectiveMaintainingCompleteTransparentAndVerifiableFinancial',
  "Recording transactions correctly and consistently": 'content.recordingTransactionsCorrectlyAndConsistently',
  "Ensuring compliance with tax and regulatory requirements": 'content.ensuringComplianceWithTaxAndRegulatoryRequirements',
  "Maintaining audit readiness at all times": 'content.maintainingAuditReadinessAtAllTimes',
  "Enforcing documentation discipline within ERP systems": 'content.enforcingDocumentationDisciplineWithinErpSystems',
  "Supporting financial reporting integrity": 'content.supportingFinancialReportingIntegrity',
  "Accuracy is protection. Documentation is control.": 'content.accuracyIsProtectionDocumentationIsControl',
  "Operations use the Mango Anywhere ERP system, which integrates project operations, procurement, asset management, and financial reporting through AP, AR, and GL modules. Operational departments initiate transactions; Accounting verifies, documents, and records them for General Ledger consolidation.": 'content.operationsUseTheMangoAnywhereErpSystem',
  "Mr. Vivich Chavananand (Head of Finance) and Mrs. Sirirat (Senior Finance Officer) will guide you through the onboarding process and help you understand the systems, responsibilities, and standards of the Finance Department.": 'content.mrVivichChavananandHeadOfFinanceAnd',
  "The Finance Department safeguards the company’s liquidity, financial stability, and long-term sustainability.": 'content.theFinanceDepartmentSafeguardsTheCompanyS',
  "Primary objective: ensuring controlled cashflow, responsible debt management, and early identification of funding gaps before operational risks emerge.": 'content.primaryObjectiveEnsuringControlledCashflowResponsibleDebt',
  "Finance safeguards liquidity through:": 'content.financeSafeguardsLiquidityThrough',
  "Monitoring cash inflows and outflows": 'content.monitoringCashInflowsAndOutflows',
  "Forecasting short- and medium-term funding requirements": 'content.forecastingShortAndMediumTermFundingRequirements',
