  "Evaluating debt servicing capacity": 'content.evaluatingDebtServicingCapacity',
  "Protecting the company from liquidity exposure": 'content.protectingTheCompanyFromLiquidityExposure',
  "Finance protects the liquidity that makes profitability sustainable.": 'content.financeProtectsTheLiquidityThatMakesProfitability',
  "The Finance Department operates within the Mango Anywhere Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) system, utilizing modules FIN, AP, and PM to manage resources, funding structure, and cash flow. The department monitors transactions across operational areas to maintain financial stability and enable strategic decision-making.": 'content.theFinanceDepartmentOperatesWithinTheMango',
  "Mrs. Thongthip Chavananand (Head of Procurement) and Mrs. Anongrak (Senior Procurement Officer) guide onboarding.": 'content.mrsThongthipChavananandHeadOfProcurementAnd',
  "The procurement function protects the company’s cost structure, liquidity timing, and supply reliability. Objective: ensure that all purchasing decisions align with project requirements, financial capacity, and governance standards.": 'content.theProcurementFunctionProtectsTheCompanyS',
  "Secure materials and services at optimal commercial terms": 'content.secureMaterialsAndServicesAtOptimalCommercial',
  "Prevent cost escalation and over-purchasing": 'content.preventCostEscalationAndOverPurchasing',
  "Align delivery schedules with project timelines": 'content.alignDeliverySchedulesWithProjectTimelines',
  "Evaluate supplier risk exposure": 'content.evaluateSupplierRiskExposure',
  "Enforce structured approval workflows": 'content.enforceStructuredApprovalWorkflows',
  "Procurement decisions directly affect project margin and cashflow stability. Cost control is not optional — it is structural protection.": 'content.procurementDecisionsDirectlyAffectProjectMarginAnd',
  "Procurement operates through the Mango Anywhere ERP system, managing purchasing activities via modules: PO, PR, and IC. Requirements flow from Engineering and Project teams through the system as purchase requests and orders.": 'content.procurementOperatesThroughTheMangoAnywhereErp',
  "Mr. Watcharit Chavananand (Head of Asset Management) and Mr. Utiss (Head of Sai-5 Maintenance Unit) lead onboarding.": 'content.mrWatcharitChavananandHeadOfAssetManagement',
  "Core function: protecting company-owned assets, inventory integrity, and operational traceability. Objective: ensure that all assets are properly registered, documented, traceable, and physically verified at all times.": 'content.coreFunctionProtectingCompanyOwnedAssetsInventory',
