  "Supporting financial reporting through asset accuracy": 'content.supportingFinancialReportingThroughAssetAccuracy',
  "Control preserves value. Uncontrolled assets create financial and governance exposure.": 'content.controlPreservesValueUncontrolledAssetsCreateFinancial',
  "Operates within the Mango Anywhere ERP system, managing asset tracking, utilization, and lifecycle across project sites and operational facilities through FA and IC modules. The system monitors machinery, equipment, materials, and facilities to ensure proper allocation, maintenance, and financial accountability, integrating with procurement, engineering, and accounting processes.": 'content.operatesWithinTheMangoAnywhereErpSystem',
  "Mr. Vivat Chavananand (Head of Engineering) and Mrs. Romanee Karunchadit (Senior Engineer Officer) guide onboarding.": 'content.mrVivatChavananandHeadOfEngineeringAnd',
  "Mission: revenue realization through accurate measurement, controlled execution, and disciplined documentation. Engineering must ensure project progress converts to certified revenue while maintaining cost efficiency and contractual compliance through:": 'content.missionRevenueRealizationThroughAccurateMeasurementControlled',
