  "On the Ground": 'content.onTheGround',
  "Site operations are carried out in a structured and controlled environment, with a focus on safety, coordination, and adherence to defined work processes.": 'content.siteOperationsAreCarriedOutInA',
  "Safety Talk": 'content.safetyTalk',
  "Each workday begins with a safety briefing to highlight potential risks, review ongoing activities, and reinforce site safety requirements. This ensures all personnel are aware of current site conditions, hazards, and control measures before work begins. Safety talks also provide an opportunity to address recent incidents, clarify procedures, and maintain a high level of safety awareness.": 'content.eachWorkdayBeginsWithASafetyBriefing',
  "Tool Box Talk": 'content.toolBoxTalk',
  "Toolbox talks are conducted regularly to review specific tasks and operational details relevant to the work being carried out. These sessions focus on correct methods, equipment usage, and coordination between teams. They ensure that all personnel understand their responsibilities and any task-specific risks before execution.": 'content.toolboxTalksAreConductedRegularlyToReview',
  "Site Training": 'content.siteTraining',
  "On-site training is provided to ensure personnel are equipped with the necessary knowledge and skills to perform their duties effectively. This includes training on equipment, procedures, and safety practices. Continuous training helps maintain consistency in work quality and ensures compliance with company standards and regulatory requirements.": 'content.onSiteTrainingIsProvidedToEnsure',
  "House Keeping": 'content.houseKeeping',
  "Housekeeping is maintained throughout the site to ensure a clean, organized, and safe working environment. Proper storage of materials, clear access routes, and regular removal of waste help reduce hazards and improve operational efficiency. Good housekeeping practices are essential to minimizing risks and maintaining site discipline.": 'content.housekeepingIsMaintainedThroughoutTheSiteTo',
  "Work in Process": 'content.workInProcess',
  "All work activities are carried out in accordance with established procedures and project plans. Defined processes ensure consistency in execution, proper documentation, and alignment with cost and schedule requirements. Adherence to these processes supports quality control, accountability, and efficient resource utilization.": 'content.allWorkActivitiesAreCarriedOutIn',
